  "name": "Passive Features",
  "description": "§e§lStats:§r\n+20% Size\n-4 Max HP\n \n§e§lFeatures:§r\n- Sunlight grants +25% movement speed.\n- Moonlight grants +20% damage dealt.\n- Your body is naturally 60% opaque. Toggleable.\n- You suffer -15% movement speed for each threshold exceeded: more than 12 Armor, more than 15 Armor, and more than 8 Armor Toughness.\n- You cannot use shields.\n- Contact with water reduces your damage dealt by 80% and applies §c§l[Silenced]§r for 3 seconds. Each additional second in water adds 3 seconds to the duration, up to 3 minutes.",
